   $q$In paragraph 5, the Pony Express became "obsolete." What does "obsolete" mean?$q$, $q$[{"text":"more popular than before","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"opposite-meaning"},{"text":"no longer needed because something better came","is_correct":true},{"text":"faster than a telegraph","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-cause-effect"},{"text":"too costly to pay for","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$no longer needed because something better came$q$, $q$The telegraph sent messages "in minutes," and the last sentence says "Nobody needed riders" after that. The text never mentions cost, so that answer is not supported.$q$, 'draft', '094e5117-61b9-5e8b-9c57-74e8d1793c3c')
